WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The Ragnarok blazes through re-entry, its hull glowing orange amid streaks of fire.

2
00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
Escort craft flank the Ragnarok as it descends toward Esthar's geometric skyline.

3
00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
From the city below, the Lunar Cry's red pillar pours down from the enormous moon.

4
00:19.500 --> 00:24.000
Burning clouds engulf the sky above Esthar's curved rails and towers.
